    "## 11. Key Findings\n",
    "\n",
    "After analysis, the main patterns to discuss in the project report are:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Free applications dominate** the Google Play Store dataset.\n",
    "2. A small number of categories contain a very large share of applications.\n",
